  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Subsea Fiber Optic Cable Technologies RTM, through Tuatara Group, LLC</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The LAC Regional Subsea Fiber Optic Cable Technologies Reverse Trade Mission will familiarize up to twelve Argentine, Chilean and Ecuadorian telecommunications sector representatives with U.S. subsea and land-based fiber optic cable technologies and related infrastructure solutions. The RTM would visit up to three cities over seven business days. The RTM itinerary would include meetings and site visits with U.S. telecommunications companies, hardware deployment firms, regulators and procurement officials.</narrative>
  </description>
